Accepted by: install, remove, purge, autoremove, autopurge, upgrade,
full-upgrade, safe-upgrade.
Hidden from --help.
.It Cm --allow-unauthenticated
Accepted by: install, remove, purge, autoremove, autopurge, upgrade,
full-upgrade, safe-upgrade.
Not available: --allow-unauthenticated is not available on xbps: xbps verifies
repository signatures and has no unauthenticated mode.
.It Cm -o , --option Ar OPTION
Accepted by: install, remove, purge, autoremove, autopurge, upgrade,
full-upgrade, safe-upgrade.
Not available: -o/--option is not available on xbps: apt configuration options
have no xbps equivalent; repository settings live in /etc/xbps.d/*.conf.
.It Cm -f , --fix-broken
Accepted by: install, remove, purge, autoremove, autopurge, upgrade,
full-upgrade, safe-upgrade.
Not available: -f/--fix-broken is not available on xbps: xbps has no
broken-dependency repair mode.
Check the pkgdb with xbps-pkgdb --checks dependencies, or force a reinstall
with xbp install followed by the option terminator -f PKG.
.It Cm -t , --target-release Ar RELEASE
Accepted by: install, remove, purge, autoremove, autopurge, upgrade,
full-upgrade, safe-upgrade.
Not available: -t/--target-release is not available on xbps: xbps has no
default-release targeting; pin a repository with a repository= line in
/etc/xbps.d.
.It Cm --install-recommends
Accepted by: install, remove, purge, autoremove, autopurge, upgrade,
full-upgrade, safe-upgrade.
Not available: --install-recommends is not available on xbps: xbps has no
recommends metadata; every declared run_depends dependency is installed.
.It Cm --install-suggests
Accepted by: install, remove, purge, autoremove, autopurge, upgrade,
full-upgrade, safe-upgrade.
Not available: --install-suggests is not available on xbps: xbps has no
suggests metadata.
.It Cm --remove-essential
Accepted by: install, remove, purge, autoremove, autopurge, upgrade,
full-upgrade, safe-upgrade.
Not available: --remove-essential is not available on xbps: xbps has no
essential-package protection to override.
.It Cm --remove-config
Accepted by: install, remove, purge, autoremove, autopurge, upgrade,
full-upgrade, safe-upgrade.
Not available: --remove-config is not available on xbps: xbps has no
config-files state; xbps-remove -f removes files, it does not create a
config-only removal.
.It Cm --exclude Ar PATTERN
Accepted by: install, remove, purge, autoremove, autopurge, upgrade,
full-upgrade, safe-upgrade.
Not available: --exclude is not available on xbps: xbps has no upgrade
exclusion; hold the package with xbps-pkgdb -m hold PKG (release with -m
unhold).
.It Cm --sources
Accepted by: fetch.
Not available: --sources is not available: Void repositories contain no source
